        fasteners, portalocker) all provide cross-platform file locking with similar LockFile-like APIs. 
        filelock is the most popular modern alternative with a nearly identical API (FileLock vs 
        LockFile). fasteners provides more primitives but supports file locking. portalocker is another 
        mature option.

